# The verdict the migration scan must give each disk of this variant (doc 05 §3). The
# builder measures every row on the disks and refuses to build a variant whose
# rows the disks do not show; expected/scan.txt is this file with those facts.
# Every data disk is adopted after its own read-only check, whatever its
# filesystem; the cache is re-created.
disk parity parity
disk disk1 adopt
disk disk2 adopt
disk disk3 adopt
disk disk4 adopt
disk cache recreated
# The flash has no config/hoserva/: the scan warns, lists every template as
# unknown and pre-selects none (Q89).
warn capture-missing
